`ContextMenu` → `create-project` → `FileExplorer.handleContextCreateProject()` → `$ui.showNewProject({ path })` (`typed-vuex` accessor commits `ui/showNewProject`, `store/ui.js:296`) → `App.vue` `<modal v-if="$ui.newProject">` → `NewProject.vue:196` reads `{ path }` → prefills **Project name** + **Project location path**, *Advanced settings* already expanded → **Create Project** → `createNewProject({ project_path })` → `POST /api/projects?project_path=…`.

